## 🚀 How to Run locally

### **Prerequisites**
- C++11 compliant compiler (`g++`, Clang, or MSVC)

### **Compilation (C++ Engine)**
```bash
# Compile with POSIX threads support
g++ -std=c++11 -pthread main.cpp -o EnrollmentSystem

# Run the executable
./EnrollmentSystem
